===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|ang}} {{m|gem-pro|*armaz}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|ang}} {{m|ine-pro|*h₂erHmos||joint}}. Cognate with {{etyl|ofs|-}} {{m|ofs|arm}}, {{etyl|osx|-}} {{m|osx|arm}}, {{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|arm}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{m|goh|arm}} ({{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|Arm}}), {{etyl|non|-}} {{m|non|armr}} ({{etyl|sv|-}} {{m|sv|arm}}), {{etyl|got|-}} {{m|got|𐌰𐍂𐌼𐍃}}. The {{etyl|ine-pro|-}} root is also the source of {{etyl|cu|-}} {{m|cu|рамо}} ({{etyl|ru|-}} {{m|ru|рамо||shoulder}}), {{etyl|la|-}} {{m|la|armus}}.

